  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s2_sub_011_girl_01",
      "hash64": "EB85F4E3122FF757",
      "text": "¡Alola!\\c\\n¿Sabes qué? Me encantan los Pokémon de Alola.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s2_sub_011_girl_02",
      "hash64": "EB85F5E3122FF90A",
      "text": "Me haría mucha ilu ver un Golem de Alola.\\c\\n¿No tendrás uno en el equipo o en las cajas que\\nme puedas enseñar?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s2_sub_011_girl_03",
      "hash64": "EB85F6E3122FFABD",
      "text": "No hay manera de encontrar un Golem de\\nAlola por ningún sitio...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s2_sub_011_girl_04",
      "hash64": "EB85EFE3122FEED8",
      "text": "¡Pero si ese Pokémon ni siquiera es un Golem!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s2_sub_011_girl_05",
      "hash64": "EB85F0E3122FF08B",
      "text": "¡Pero si ese es un Golem de los de toda la vida!\\nYo lo que quiero es ver uno de Alola, ¡¡de Alola!!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s2_sub_011_girl_06",
      "hash64": "EB85F1E3122FF23E",
      "text": "¡Eso es! ¡Un Golem de Alola! ¡¡Yupiii!!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s2_sub_011_girl_07",
      "hash64": "EB85F2E3122FF3F1",
      "text": "¡Con esas cejotas, ese bigotazo y esos dos bultos\\nsobre la cabeza, tiene un aire de lo más exótico!\\r\\n¡Jo, menuda impresión da!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s2_sub_011_girl_08",
      "hash64": "EB85EBE3122FE80C",
      "text": "Evolucionan por intercambio, así que no es nada\\ncomún verlos en estado salvaje...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s2_sub_011_girl_09",
      "hash64": "EB85ECE3122FE9BF",
      "text": "Para darte las gracias, te voy a enseñar un gesto\\nque combina lo mejor de Alola y de Golem.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s2_sub_011_system_01",
      "hash64": "340BF1E47E73D21E",
      "text": "¡La chica te ha enseñado el gesto [VAR 0xFF00(0008)]Electrostal Z[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s2_sub_011_girl_npc",
      "hash64": "392CDFD8F127896B",
      "text": "¡Lo más importante de todo es poner las manos\\nen el ángulo correcto!\\c\\n¡Y más te vale gritar \"¡Alolaaa!\" bien alto!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
